<title>HUNGARY: OTP BANK RELEASES AUDITED IAS 1996 FIGURES.</title>
<headline>OTP BANK RELEASES AUDITED IAS 1996 FIGURES.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				  Jan-Dec 1996     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Income after tax	  10,686    vs	7,328</p>
<p>    Income before tax	 13,973    vs	9,272</p>
<p>    Net interest income     59,209 profit vs 52,943 profit</p>
<p>	Interest income	190,069    vs    181,386</p>
<p>	Interest expense     130,860    vs    128,443</p>
<p>    Provisions		   7,229    vs	9,260</p>
<p>    Non interest income     25,308 profit vs 21,511</p>
<p>    Non interest expense    63,315    vs     55,925</p>
<p>    Income taxes		 3,287    vs	1,944</p>
<p>NOTE - Orszagos Takarekpenztar es Kereskedelmi Bank Rt</p>
<p>is Hungary's largest commercial bank.</p>
<p>The figures are audited, unconsolidated and were calculated</p>
<p>in accordance with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
